@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Versioned base route
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Accept: application/json

### Database connection (requires the accessToken returned by the login)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/house/database
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Accept: application/json

### Register with email and password
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.com",
  "password": "Abcdefgh12"
}

### Log in with email and password (the user must have confirmed the email)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.com",
  "password": "Abcdefgh12"
}

### Renew the session (refreshToken from the login or the previous renewal)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refresh-token>"
}

### Confirm the email (6-digit code from the verification email)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Request the password recovery (always 202, whether or not the email exists)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.com"
}

### Set the new password (token from the link in the recovery email)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<token-from-the-email-link>",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123"
}

### Change the password (requires the accessToken returned by the login; the other sessions are closed)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Abcdefgh12",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123"
}

### CORS disallowed origin
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Origin: http://disallowed-origin.example
Accept: application/json

### CORS allowed origin
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Accept: application/json
